               5 custom vocabulary terms. Pro $8.33/user/mo annual or $16.99 monthly, 1,200 min/mo, 90 min per conversation.
               Business $19.99/user/mo annual or $30 monthly, unlimited minutes, 4 hours per conversation. Otter MCP server listed.
               Privacy policy (effective 2026-06-16) describes training its AI on de-identified audio recordings.
               Desktop app for Mac and Windows records without a bot (still uploads to Otter's cloud).
             All claims are source-verified from official pages. Last verified: 2026-10-17. -->
